      "writtenOn": "2018-09-21T02:29:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this and the next macro are very cool and all :) but not very portable, and I am not sure is necessary: task reset would be requested very seldom, is it a big deal to just run the logic with disabled interrupts?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
