      "message": "I am not sure what the utility would be of calling task_reset(), also, not sure we need the \u0027wait\u0027 option: yes, tpm_reset sometimes does have to wait, but I am not sure task_reset() needs this, we  should be able to use some other means in case then TPM reset needs to be confirmed.",
